      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IT'S FRIDAY (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at Warragul in a handy 23.09 beating Warrior Tommy. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. ZIPPING GLINDA (7) failed to feature last start after settling well back at Healesville, but prior to that won by half a length at Shepparton (22.52) beating Spring Queue in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on July 30. Shapes as one to consider. ASTON KILLARA (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Warragul behind Daintree Damage (23.37) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Must be included in calculations. NEWBROCK TILLY (2) comes into calculations after placing most recently.",
